            "part_id": 6432,
            "question_type": "GAP_FILLING",
            "question_count": 10,
            "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>DESIGNING A PUBLIC BUILDING:</strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>THE TAYLOR CONCERT HALL</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>Introduction</strong></p>\n<p>The designer of a public building may need to consider the building&rsquo;s</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;function</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;physical and <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span> context</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;symbolic meaning</p>\n<p><strong>Location and concept of the Concert Hall</strong></p>\n<p>On the site of a disused <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span></p>\n<p>Beside a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span></p>\n<p>The design is based on the concept of a mystery</p>\n<p><strong>Building design</strong></p>\n<p>It&rsquo;s approached by a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span>&nbsp;for pedestrians</p>\n<p>The building is the shape of a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span></p>\n<p>One exterior wall acts as a large <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span></p>\n<p>In the auditorium:</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;the floor is built on huge pads made of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;the walls are made of local wood and are <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span>&nbsp;in shape</p>\n<div class=\"google-auto-placed ap_container\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle adsbygoogle-noablate\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-7361163811890432\" data-adsbygoogle-status=\"done\" data-ad-status=\"unfilled\">\n<div id=\"aswift_5_host\"><iframe id=\"aswift_5\" tabindex=\"0\" title=\"Advertisement\" src=\"https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/ads?gdpr=0&amp;client=ca-pub-7361163811890432&amp;output=html&amp;h=280&amp;adk=1407987496&amp;adf=3494119633&a